# ── Misc local files ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.Rhistory
handoff.md

# ── macOS metadata ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
._*
**/._*

# ── Wrangler CLI cache ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.wrangler/

# ── Deploy: photos only (637 MB — GitHub-hostile, reproducible from img/ + photos.csv) ──
deploy/miles/

# ── Large photo archives ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
raw-photos-save/
img/

# ── Sensitive / spoiler-y data ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# photos.csv maps random photo IDs → real trail miles (answers cheat sheet)
misc/photos.csv

# supabase_config.py holds the publishable anon key — safe to expose but
# conventional to gitignore. Copy misc/supabase_config.template.py to get started.
misc/supabase_config.py

# ── Third-party source data (consumed by misc/ prep scripts) ──────────────────
# Halfmile PCT GPS waypoints. add_geo_columns.py reads this to fill photos.csv
# lat/lon/map. Not ours to redistribute, so kept local like the raw photos.
misc/halfmiles_pct_notes_gps and miles.xlsx
# Excel lock/temp files (e.g. ~$workbook.xlsx) created while a sheet is open
**/~$*

# ── Local-only tools ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
app-explore/

# ── Generated HTML build artifacts ───────────────────────────────────────────
# Regenerated locally by each app-*/build.py, then deployed via wrangler.
app-landing/index.html
app-game/practice/index.html
app-game/scored/index.html
app-leaderboard/index.html
app-leaderboard/all-time/
app-hiker/index.html
app-admin/index.html
